flowchart TD
A[Create unique job ID] --> B[Check saved manifest]
B --> C{Same job and content}
C -->|Yes| D[Return existing result]
C -->|No| E[Reject conflicting reuse]
B --> F[New job]
F --> G[Render into temporary folder]
G --> H{All outputs verified}
H -->|No| I[Keep failure log and stop]
H -->|Yes| J[Save hashes and final manifest]
J --> D
